    narr:generatedFrom "6554c93c5c55a181b729ea30886d1ffe6558631d" ;
    narr:narration """Tanya's voice here is a chair running a tight meeting toward a decision she has already largely made. She opens by [bounding the discussion against a steering-group deadline](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_1), then [states her landing position on sequencing before hearing others out](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_8), and defends it by [pricing the two cutovers as a contained versus an unbounded risk](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_13). She probes rather than accepts — [asking where a two-week figure comes from](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_18) — and once satisfied, [ratifies the reasoning on the record](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_20). She converts agreements into rules, [ordering the replica reporting constraint written as a rule, not guidance](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_31), and adds a [political framing that keeps reference-data blame on the vendor](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_39). She closes by [rehearsing exactly what she will tell the steering group](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_42). The register is casual-but-commanding: antithesis and parallelism dominate her org-lane style, and she runs consultation and legitimate authority side by side.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_11> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_13> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_16> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_18> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_20> ;
